lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":false,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Caterers, Restaurants, Mexican, Event Planning & Services, Food, Tacos, Bartenders, Food Delivery Services\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rasta Taco Catering\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-10-17 02:27:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Absolutely wonderful way to spice up any event! Mario and his crew knock it out of the park!  The margarita truck added such a fun atmosphere to my party! Highly recommend the cucumber jalapeno margarita!  I would book this for any future event here!  Thank you Rasta Rita!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-07-12 16:42:49\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Rasta Rita was used for a military event and was such a hit! Mario is super friendly to work with and is always willing to help out.  The truck was so fun and the drinks were delicious! Everyone at our event had such a fun time interacting with the truck and sipping the yummy margaritas.  What an amazing concept!  We are using the truck again this year as it has been such a hot item!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-07-31 03:14:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Mario was freaking amazing !!!! He was so charismatic and instinctful !! He's defiantly a one man show !! I would refer him for any event !! He bartender my friend Pilar wedding and did a amazing job !!!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Rasta Taco Catering is a highly-rated business located at 3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333 in Carpinteria, California. It offers a variety of services including catering, event planning, food delivery, and bartending, with a specific focus on Mexican cuisine. Its business hours are from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm on weekdays, and 9:00 am to 2:00 pm on weekends. Customers rave about the business's ability to enhance events with their services. Notable mentions include a margarita truck that adds a fun atmosphere to parties and a charismatic staff member named Mario. It has been noted that Rasta Taco Catering is a hit at military events and weddings. The business also offers street parking and outdoor seating to its customers.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
