was close by, and we are so glad we did. Taco Grande serves up delicious food, generous portions, great prices, excellent service, and one of the best salsas I have ever eaten. We will definitely be back.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-04-20 04:48:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Was there in March. Nobody wears masks or says hello and it was empty. Went to rudys across the street and it was great.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"El Taco Grande is a casual Mexican restaurant located at 1096 Casitas Pass Rd in Carpinteria, CA. The restaurant is open from 9 AM to 8 PM from Tuesday to Thursday and Saturday to Sunday, while on Fridays it closes at 3 PM. It is closed on Mondays. El Taco Grande offers outdoor seating and is suitable for groups. It does not provide WiFi and does not accept reservations. The restaurant has a 3-star rating overall, but some customers rate it higher for its excellent food, generous portions, great prices, and excellent service. Signature dishes include the Chile Relleno, crispy tacos, carne asada burritos, and Caldo 7 Mares. However, one customer noted a lack of COVID-19 safety measures in place during their visit in March 2021.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
