ts preferences over the health and safety of its customers and employees.\\n\\nOn the other hand, a different customer had a positive experience and appreciated the wide variety of items available, specifically mentioning the organic coffee.\\n\\nOverall, AH Juice Organics has received a rating of 3.5 stars. While some customers have enjoyed their food and found the business to be friendly, others have raised concerns about the lack of COVID-19 safety measures.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
