 coated chicken pieces into the hot oil, ensuring they are completely submerged.\\n4. Fry the chicken until it reaches an internal temperature of 165F.\\n5. The cooking time may vary depending on the type of chicken piece, approximately 10 minutes for white meat, 14 minutes for dark meat, and 7 minutes for wings.\\n\\nTherefore, the chicken should be completely done when it reaches an internal temperature of 165F while frying.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
