ry in the season opener, leaving the team to rely on the likes of Gus Edwards and Justive Hill, along with Melvin Gordon.\\nThe leads to the Ravens having interest in Henry, and likely being the most aggressive in landing him.\\nRegardless of where he lands, it appears likely that Henry will be on the move next week.\", \"answer\": \"The Baltimore Ravens are expected to make a big move by acquiring running back Derrick Henry from the Tennessee Titans before the NFL Trade deadline. The Titans seem to be embracing a rebuild and may be sellers at the deadline. Henry, despite a less productive season in 2023, is still considered one of the best running backs in the league. The Ravens, with their strong rushing offense and lack of depth at the position, are seen as the frontrunners to land Henry. It is likely that Henry will be traded next week.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
