iewer complained that the quality and size of the sandwiches have decreased significantly over time, leaving them disappointed. On the other hand, one customer had a positive experience and recommended Cantwell's for its fast and friendly service. Overall, while Cantwell's has a diverse menu and offers outdoor seating and free WiFi, they need to improve their operational procedures and communication skills.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
