ievable. The woman behind the counter insisted that she packed four items, but as i just said, there were five. We ordered two of the Italian sandwich and we were shorted one of those because they probably didn't read the order carefully. So the woman made the second sandwich, then practically threw it at our picker-upper. Seriously? He wasn't rude to her or anything, and while we would have just chalked it up to an oversight, the deli worker who unloaded on us made everything worse. Food was fine, but the service today means we are no longer customers. Yikes! Happy freaking holidays.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-14 20:16:52\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"What happened, Cantwell's? You used to be the go to for big tasty sandwiches? The market is still great but the quality and size of your sandwiches are the same as a supermarket deli. Very sad!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-10 15:35:37\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We stayed in a hotel across the street and Cantwell was our place to grab a sandwich and drinks to go before heading out.\\\\n\\\\nService is fast and the sandwiches were tasty! The people behind the counter were friendly and efficient. The perfect place to grab a bite or a bottle of wine.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Cantwell's Market & Deli is a food establishment located at 1533 State St, Santa Barbara, CA. It operates from Monday to Sunday with varying hours. They offer a variety of food options such as breakfast and brunch, groceries, sandwiches, beer, wine and spirits, meat shops, delis, specialty food, restaurants, and health markets. Customers can enjoy outdoor seating and free WiFi. The restaurant does not take reservations, and the ambiance is casual. Based on the available structured data, it appears that their focus is more on the convenience of quick meals rather than formal dining experiences.\\n\\nOne customer left a negative review, stating that they placed an order online, but the staff failed to check their order and the order was shorted by one item. Additionally, the customer reported that the deli worker who picked up the order was rude and made the situation worse. Another reviewer complained that the quality and size of the sandwiches have decreased significantly over time, leaving them disappointed. On the other hand, one customer had a positive experience and recommended Cantwell's for its fast and friendly service. Overall, while Cantwell's has a diverse menu and offers outdoor seating and free WiFi, they need to improve their operational procedures and communication skills.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
