he green makes me feel a little bit better about neglecting my vegetables.\\\\n\\\\nraspberry shock top beer.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Momma Donna is a locally loved restaurant in Santa Barbara, California, known for its delicious American cuisine, particularly their exceptional burgers. According to customer reviews, the restaurant has a cozy and welcoming atmosphere, with friendly and personable staff who make guests feel like part of the family. The menu features a variety of mouth-watering options, including their famous PB & J Burger, which is made with freshly ground meat, avocado, caramelized onions, and bacon, served on a homemade bun. Other popular dishes include macaroni and cheese with mushrooms and caramelized bacon, as well as grilled cheese with tomato and arugula. Additionally, Momma Donna offers a great selection of craft beers, including the highly recommended Raspberry Shock Top Beer. Customers rave about the quality of the food and the warm hospitality, making Momma Donna a must-visit spot for anyone looking for a casual, comfortable dining experience in Santa Barbara.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
