n, try browsing any of the Pastafarian scriptures. The most important book to Pastafarians is the Gospel of the Flying Spaghetti Monster.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how to become a pastafarian\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided passages, here is how one can become a Pastafarian:\\n\\n1. Learn about the basic Pastafarian beliefs, which include believing in a great noodly god (instead of saying 'amen', say 'RAmen') and embracing a life of fun and debauchery (e.g., enjoying grog, wenches, and days off work). (Passages 1 and 2)\\n2. At every available opportunity, talk like and/or dress as a Pastafarian, particularly when preaching the word. (Passage 1)\\n3. Study the sacred texts of Pastafarianism, including the Gospel of the Flying Spaghetti Monster, which is the most important book to Pastafarians. (Passage 3)\\n4. Celebrate all Pastafarian holidays, such as every Friday (Our Sabbath) and Talk Like a Pirate Day (September 19th). (Passage 2)\\n5. End all prayers with 'RAmen'. (Passage 4)\\n6. Above all, have fun with it! (Passage 1)\\n\\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide detailed instructions on how to become a Pastafarian, such as any specific rituals or initiation ceremonies.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
