ars for gas furnaces.\\n\\nTherefore, the main differences between gas and oil are their source, environmental impact, and longevity of the appliances.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
