lock is part of Master Lock.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how to reset a master lock 4 digit\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"To reset a Master Lock 4 digit combination lock, first ensure that the lock is set to the current combination. Insert the reset tool into the hole on the side of the lock and turn it 90 degrees. With the dials set at 0-0-0-0, pull out the shackle. Rotate the shackle 90 degrees so that the notch on the shackle aligns with the notch in the lock body. Press and hold the shackle down, then set the dials to your desired combination by aligning the middle of the numbers with the red stripe.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
