sgusted. Another customer, however, had a more positive experience, highlighting the coffee and the beautiful view over the pier. They recommended visiting early in the morning for a coffee and enjoying the seating on the rail.\\n\\nThe business has outdoor seating and offers takeout services. They also accept reservations and have validated parking available. However, their overall rating is 3.0 stars.\\n\\nChar West is known for its casual outdoor dining area with a gorgeous view of the ocean and the hills of Santa Barbara. The staff, including Francisco and Blanca, are friendly and provide excellent service. They serve a range of espresso drinks and have a breakfast and lunch menu available, with the huevos rancheros being a personal favorite.\\n\\nIn conclusion, Char West offers a mix of seafood, fast food, and breakfast options in a casual outdoor setting with scenic views. The quality of their fish and chips seems to vary, but they excel in providing a pleasant coffee experience with a beautiful atmosphere.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
