3.38.515.676 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Judge whether any answer claim is unsupported by the complete source. Return only JSON with p_hallucination (0 to 1), quote (one verbatim source string of at most 32 words, or null), byte_start and byte_end (half-open UTF-8 byte offsets, or null). A quote is evidence to inspect, not an entailment certificate. Do not use external knowledge. Input JSON follows:\n{\"source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"220 W Carrillo St, Ste 1\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Food, Restaurants, Donuts\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"5:0-2:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Spudnuts Donuts\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-27 01:50:28\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Come here for your donut and bagel needs! They have a wide selection of donuts and your typical plain, jalape\u00f1o and cheese, and everything bagel that are decently sized and fluffy and good. Not chewy or hard like other places. The cream cheese requested along with it is creamy and delicious. Their ham and cheese croissant are a quick grab to go sandwich for a meal. They carry a vast array of donuts and are decently priced especially if ordering for a group. The staff is kind, nice and accommodating.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-09-30 23:32:42\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"These are some great donuts. \\\\n\\\\nI remember coming here for the very first time and thinking just how awesome it was to try a donut crafted with potato flower (hence the name). They don't taste like potatoes so don't be fooled. If you didn't know the difference, you'd think they were the exact same as the traditional variation. \\\\n\\\\nThe location is prime, sandwiched between the 101 and State Street in the heart of downtown. It's walking distance from my house and I enjoy coming down on a weekend morning. The selection is consistently full of choices and the donuts positively melt in your mouth. I've come when they are hot out of the kitchen and they are just breathtaking. \\\\n\\\\nSpudnuts is known for the Cronut donuts which feature the flaky consistency of a croissant. They cost a bit more than the regular donuts here, but I'd say that they are a must-try. They also have an assortment of bagels and made-to-order sandwiches, though I haven't tried any of these. I'm sure they're awesome. \\\\n\\\\nThe weekend is near and I will definitely pay this little shop a visit.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-08-11 23:47:50\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I like this place because its walking distance from my house :) I guess in the past people have had bad experiences with customer service but they've always been pleasant when I come in. The donuts are pretty good, nothing out of the ordinary but there's a wide variety of options to choose from. \\\\n\\\\nNot 5 stars because I always feel like I should be paying a dollar less and they've been randomly closed at odd hours when they should be open (I'm talking middle of the day. This might be due to low employment from the pandemic though)\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Spudnuts Donuts is a food and restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA. The business operates Monday through Sunday from 5:00 PM to 2:00 AM. They offer a wide selection of donuts and bagels, as well as made-to-order sandwiches. Spudnuts is known for their unique and creative donut creations, such as the potato flower donut and the cronut. Customers have praised the quality and freshness of the donuts, as well as the friendly and accommodating staff. The location is conveniently situated in the heart of downtown, walking distance from many popular tourist attractions and residential areas. Overall, Spudnuts Donuts offers a satisfying and enjoyable dining experience for both locals and tourists alike.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
