\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-24 21:41:51\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Their pho is great!!!!When I walked in the restaurant, I wasn't sure if I should try the pho since the menu is mix with pizzas and burgers! But we decided to try, and surprisingly their pho is good! The broth reminded us the flavor in Vietnam! You should def try!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"4 Eggs & Pizza is a local business located at 1221 State St, Ste 10 in Santa Barbara, CA. The business offers a diverse range of cuisines, including Vietnamese, Pizza, Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants, and Gluten-Free options. The operating hours are from 8:00 am to 8:00 pm on Monday, Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday, and from 8:00 am to 8:00 pm on Saturday. On Sundays, the business opens slightly later, starting at 11:30 am and closing at 8:00 pm. \\n\\nBased on customer reviews, 4 Eggs & Pizza receives a 5.0-star rating. Customers have praised the restaurant for its pho, spring rolls, and bahn mi. The quality of the beef used in the dishes has been highlighted as a positive aspect. The spring rolls are described as crispy and fluffy. Customers have been pleasantly surprised by the pho's authentic flavor, reminiscent of the taste found in Vietnam. The restaurant also offers outdoor seating and accepts reservations. Takeout services are available, making it convenient for customers who prefer to enjoy their meals at home. Overall, 4 Eggs & Pizza is recommended for its delicious Vietnamese cuisine and hidden gem status in Santa Barbara.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
