he deed back to the lender. The goal is to reduce the potential loss being incurred by a lender when the borrower is delinquent. This can include lowering the interest rate and extending the term to up to 40 years. New procedures have been put in place to facilitate borrowers\u2019 access to foreclosure avoidance options, providing consistent and meaningful protections for borrowers.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
