ful, airing weekdays on CBS and streaming on Paramount Plus. Please share your thoughts with me in the comments section below. Remember to follow me to read more of my content.\", \"answer\": \"In an upcoming episode of 'The Bold and the Beautiful,' Hope Logan will make a move on John 'Finn' Finnegan, which will reignite the feud between her and Steffy Forrester. Hope believes Finn deserves better than Steffy and confides in her mother about her feelings. Finn and Hope will bond over their dislike for Sheila Carter and plot a way to break up her relationship with Deacon Sharpe. Steffy may soon find out about the developing connection between Finn and Hope.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
