. It really is everything.\\n\", \"answer\": \"New Line Cinema is planning a Christmas movie featuring Mariah Carey. The untitled project will be produced by Jonathan Shestack and co-produced by director Brett Ratner. The movie will showcase how music can transport you back in time and it's expected to be the perfect Christmas movie fans of Mariah Carey would hope for.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
