eir intelligence, including tool use, enemy identification, problem-solving, and mimicry. The size difference between the two is usually noticeable when they are seen together.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
