ng classic superhero footage featuring Adam West and Christopher Reeve instead of Ben Affleck and Henry Cavill. The 18-year-old creator started making YouTube videos when he was 11 and has since worked for the Made In Network in Nashville, Tennessee. His parody trailer received positive feedback from viewers.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
