r charcoal grill. 2  2 On each of 4 (11-inch) metal skewers, thread chicken pieces, leaving 1/4-inch space between each piece. 3  3 Place kabobs on grill over medium heat. 4  4 Microwave remaining barbecue sauce mixture uncovered on High 20 to 30 seconds or until thoroughly heated.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how do you cook kabobs on the grill\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to cook kabobs on the grill:\\n\\n1. Heat the grill to a medium heat. (Passage 2)\\n2. Skewer the ingredients end-to-end on the sticks. (Passage 1 and Passage 3)\\n3. Place kabobs on grill over medium heat. (Passage 3)\\n4. Cook for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until the chicken is cooked through and the vegetables are tender. (Not specified in the passages)\\n5. Remove the kebabs from the grill and place them on a clean plate or platter. (Passage 1)\\n\\nTherefore, the steps to cook kabobs on the grill are: heat the grill, skewer the ingredients, place kabobs on grill, cook for 8-10 minutes, and remove from grill.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
