he kebabs from the grill and place them on a clean plate or platter. (Passage 1)\\n\\nTherefore, the steps to cook kabobs on the grill are: heat the grill, skewer the ingredients, place kabobs on grill, cook for 8-10 minutes, and remove from grill.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
