sed on the provided structured data:\\n\\nBuena Onda at Mosaic Locale is a comfort food restaurant located in downtown Santa Barbara, California. It offers a variety of empanadas, as well as other menu items such as sandwiches, salads, and desserts. The restaurant has a cozy atmosphere with outdoor seating and free WiFi. Customers have praised the restaurant's friendly service and delicious food, particularly the empanadas, which are made fresh daily. Some reviewers have noted that the prices are reasonable and the portions are generous. However, some reviewers have also mentioned that the quality of the empanadas can vary depending on the type and that the menu could benefit from more vegetarian and vegan options. Overall, Buena Onda at Mosaic Locale is a great spot for a casual meal or snack in downtown Santa Barbara.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
