ws mention a bad oyster shucker, over-salted octopus, and forgetfulness in serving drinks. Additionally, some reviewers noted that the restaurant was understaffed and disorganized. Despite these issues, the restaurant has potential and offers great salads and lobster. Reservations are accepted, and Wi-Fi is not available.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
