ustomers. The restaurant offers outdoor seating, takeout, and reservations, and accepts major credit cards. The menu features a variety of Tex-Mex dishes, including tacos, burritos, and quesadillas. Some reviewers have praised the restaurant's fresh and delicious food, while others have complained about slow service and disorganization. One reviewer described the restaurant as \\\"a great little spot\\\" with friendly staff and a delightful experience, while another reviewer criticized the lack of service and long wait times. Overall, Cielo appears to be a mixed bag, with some patrons enjoying their experiences and others being disappointed.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
