ation and then we started hearing about what a busy weekend they'd had but they'd check on the reservation -- as we watched the chef leave through the front door.  Then we were told they were out of many items due to earlier business.\\\\n\\\\nSince we didn't get to eat, I can't comment on the food.  I later heard that the restaurant is under new management -- if this is true, I'd suggest some intensive staff training.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-11-11 01:42:10\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Really not pleased with the visit tonight. I've had so much better from this place in the past. We had a hair in out fries.Nuff said.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Sure! Here's an objective overview of The Hungry Cat based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nThe Hungry Cat is a Wine Bar and Restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA, with a rating of 3.5 stars based on customer reviews. The menu offers American New cuisine, Seafood, Cocktail Bars, and Nightlife. The restaurant has a modern atmosphere without being too formal or drab, and the outdoor seating area is available for guests to enjoy. However, there have been some issues with the kitchen and service, as some reviews mention a bad oyster shucker, over-salted octopus, and forgetfulness in serving drinks. Additionally, some reviewers noted that the restaurant was understaffed and disorganized. Despite these issues, the restaurant has potential and offers great salads and lobster. Reservations are accepted, and Wi-Fi is not available.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
