 cover loosely with aluminum foil. Bake at 325 degrees and heat to 165 degrees.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how do you reheat food for hot holding\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"To reheat food for hot holding, it must be heated to a minimum temperature of 165 \u00b0F for 15 seconds within 2 hours. This process should be done using proper procedures to ensure food safety. The temperature of the food should be checked with a clean, sanitized, and calibrated thermometer before serving.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
