es with sauce in an oven-safe pan and cover loosely with aluminum foil. Bake at 325 degrees and heat to 165 degrees.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how do you reheat food for hot holding\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"To reheat food for hot holding, it must be heated to a minimum temperature of 165 \u00b0F for 15 seconds within 2 hours. This process should be done using proper procedures to ensure food safety. The temperature of the food should be checked with a clean, sanitized, and calibrated thermometer before serving.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
