re you are maintaining your weight from week to week, you\u2019re done. That\u2019s how many calories you need to eat per day to maintain your current weight.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how many calories do i need to eat to maintain my current weight\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the given passages, the number of calories needed to maintain your current weight varies depending on factors such as age, gender, and activity level. Women ages 19 to 30 generally require 1,800 to 2,400 calories a day, females ages 31 to 50 need about 1,800 to 2,200 calories, and women over age 50 usually require about 1,600 to 2,200 calories a day. However, it is recommended to conduct a simple 4-step experiment to accurately determine the exact number of calories needed to maintain your weight. Adjusting your daily calorie intake in small increments may be necessary until you reach a point where you are maintaining your weight from week to week.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
