r experience. Overall, Super Cuca's Restaurant seems to be a popular spot for Mexican food in Santa Barbara, with a mix of positive and neutral reviews from its customers.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
