ught out with an open-air beach vibe. Overall, Test Pilot is a great spot for those looking for a unique and fun nightlife experience in Santa Barbara.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
