8.21.451.027 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Judge whether any answer claim is unsupported by the complete source. Return only JSON with p_hallucination (0 to 1), quote (one verbatim source string of at most 32 words, or null), byte_start and byte_end (half-open UTF-8 byte offsets, or null). A quote is evidence to inspect, not an entailment certificate. Do not use external knowledge. Input JSON follows:\n{\"source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"7 E Anapamu St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":null,\\\"intimate\\\":null,\\\"romantic\\\":true,\\\"touristy\\\":null,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":null},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":true,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":false,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mexican, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"16:30-22:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"17:0-22:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"17:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"16:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:30-14:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"16:30-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"La Cocina Mexican Restaurant\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-02-19 22:25:55\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This is a hidden gem, truly. The courtyard is beyond romantic, dining under hundred year old olive trees. Service is superb. Cocktails are beautiful and so good. Food is unbelievably yum, especially the yellowtail tostadas! Can't wait to go back for lunch! A perfect spot for a big party or a romantic date.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-01-31 03:02:23\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"La Cocina is all the things you look for in a Santa Barbara Mexican restaurant: harnessing the city's natural beauty, Latin elegance, gorgeous local produce behind each dish, outdoor dining in a twinkling light courtyard, unpretentious staff, stiff drinks and a nice wine list. From the minute the salsa comes to the table, you know this is a different experience.  The salsa is fresh, made just moments before, out of ingredients you can't quite pin down because it's nowhere in the ballpark of regular Mexican restaurant salsa. Then the guacamole makes you weep. We ordered the Padron chilies -- blistered and soft and petite which are sprinkled in a creamy poblano sauce. Honestly I can't say enough about the cuisine here.  I even had  a roasted romaine salad who he could have been just pedestrian but in the hands of La Cocina it was elevated with nuts, pepitas, corn and a creamy dressing, became a fantastic entree. I will come back just for that salad. And the peppers. My husband got the ducks de Leche and was blown away. This is my new favorite spot in downtown SB for a chic date night.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-01-28 04:42:51\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Met friends and had an exceptional experience. Great food, great service and a great time! \\\\nEnjoyed the Dip de Frijoles, Ranch Mussels, and the Pasilla Relleno (pictured). \\\\nEverything tasted so fresh - amazing food! Will be back for many times to come!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"La Cocina Mexican Restaurant is a highly-rated dining establishment located at 7 E Anapamu St, Santa Barbara, CA. Specializing in Mexican cuisine, the restaurant is open throughout the week with varying hours. It offers a romantic and trendy ambiance, with outdoor seating available. Other features include free WiFi and the ability to accommodate large groups. However, it does not offer takeout or reservations. Parking is available on the street or in the garage. Customer reviews highlight the superb service, beautiful cocktails, and delicious food, particularly the yellowtail tostadas, Padron chilies, and the roasted romaine salad. The restaurant's fresh and unique salsa and guacamole also receive high praise. Guests appreciate the romantic, twinkling light courtyard and the unpretentious staff, making La Cocina a popular choice for both big parties and intimate date nights.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
