ptions including American traditional, event planning, catering, and takeout. The business has a rating of 3.5 stars and receives mixed reviews from customers. Some patrons have expressed disappointment with the restaurant's policies, such as charging extra for customizations on breakfast/brunch dishes, while others have criticized the lack of employee mask-wearing during the COVID-19 pandemic. Reviews also mention bland food and poor container quality. Despite this, some customers have praised the business's friendly and efficient staff. Overall, Mulligan's Cafe & Bar appears to have a decent reputation among locals but could benefit from improvements in areas such as service and food quality.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
