g medium. (Passage 1)\\n\\nStar Topology: A network where each computer is connected to a central hub using a point-to-point connection. (Passage 2)\\n\\nMesh Topology: A network where messages can take any of several possible paths from source to destination, introduced the concept of routes. (Passage 3)\\n\\nNote that the passages do not provide information about the meaning of Ring or Tree topology, so I am unable to answer those parts of the question.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
