8.50.808.219 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Judge whether any answer claim is unsupported by the complete source. Return only JSON with p_hallucination, a number from 0 to 1. Do not use external knowledge. Input JSON follows:\n{\"source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"116 Santa Barbara St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":true,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":false,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Soul Food, Wine Tasting Room, Food, Restaurants, Arts & Entertainment, Vegan, Mexican, American (Traditional), Nightlife, Wineries, Bars\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:30-20:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:30-20:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:30-20:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:30-20:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nook\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-13 03:42:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"The service was fine, but I ordered a Reuben sandwich and it was almost inedible. Dry as a bone and the meat was like rubber. Really disappointed, as I know many of the other dishes are excellent.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-28 05:30:25\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Hearty food that pairs well with beer!\\\\n\\\\nI've been fortunate enough to dine here several times when I've patronized the watering holes at The Waterline - no pun intended! It's uniquely situated within the confines of this building, in what looks to be a converted storage container. Pretty cool. \\\\n\\\\nRegardless of day or time, there is usually a line for The Nook. I see it as a testament to their quality. Each time I've ordered from here, the food is just that. They make a great ahi sandwich and their pretzel bun burger is delicious. The pricing isn't cheap, items start at around $14, but I'd say that the cost is on par with the competition. You certainly get a good bang for your buck. \\\\n\\\\nYou don't necessarily have to patronize one of the taprooms to order food from here - simply just walk in and get in line. Worth it!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-17 04:53:36\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I love coming to Lama for a beer and getting a turkey burger from the Nook! I've had a bunch of things on their menu but I think the fried chicken sandwich and the turkey burger are my favorite. If you're not hungry for a full meal, their truffle fries are also a great snack to go with your beer. I highly recommend coming here for dinner, a beer, and watching a game or just hanging with friends!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of Nook:\\n\\nNook is a local business located in Santa Barbara, California, offering a variety of dining options including Soul Food, Wine Tasting Room, Food, Restaurants, Arts & Entertainment, Vegan, Mexican, American (Traditional), Nightlife, Wineries, Bars. With a rating of 4.0 out of 5 stars, Nook has received positive reviews for its hearty food that pairs well with beer, generous portions, and good value for money. However, some reviewers have noted that the service can be hit or miss, with one reviewer experiencing poor service and another enjoying a pleasant dining experience. The business hours are as follows: Monday to Saturday from 11:30 AM to 20:00 PM, Sunday from 11:30 AM to 20:00 PM. Free WiFi is available, and reservations are not accepted. Outdoor seating is also available, making it a great spot to enjoy a meal while taking in the local atmosphere.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
