 place. Delicious gyros! I got mine without tzatziki sauce (allergies) and it was still fulfilling. I did taste a bit from my husband's and it was so good! Owner was great and glad to share a few laughs for a bit given our days of late.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"\\\"Yanni's Greek & American Deli\\\" is a local business located at 3102 State St, Santa Barbara, CA. It operates from 10:00 am to 5:00 pm from Monday to Saturday. This establishment is categorized under Restaurants, Gas Stations, Delis, Automotive, and Greek. The deli offers a variety of amenities such as outdoor seating, a parking lot, and takeout services. However, they do not provide WiFi, music, or a restaurant reservation service. The business has an average rating of 4.5 stars. Customer reviews are mixed, with some praising the quick delivery service and delicious gyros, while one review reports that the business was closed.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
