ices. However, they do not provide WiFi, music, or a restaurant reservation service. The business has an average rating of 4.5 stars. Customer reviews are mixed, with some praising the quick delivery service and delicious gyros, while one review reports that the business was closed.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
