is all about pushing the edge to see how high can you charge and  for how little.? \\\\nGood question. My guess is you may soon find out and end up making less profit even with higher prices.  Ex.  We used to order weekly and now ... we'll not so often and not so much. But hey I could be wrong.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of TAP Thai Cuisine:\\n\\nLocated in Santa Barbara, California, TAP Thai Cuisine is a popular Thai restaurant known for its affordable prices and delicious dishes. The restaurant offers a variety of options, including traditional Thai favorites such as pad thai and drunken noodles, as well as vegetarian and vegan options. The restaurant has a rating of 3.5 stars and receives positive reviews for its food quality and value. However, some reviewers have complained about long wait times and poor service. Despite these issues, many patrons praise the restaurant's atmosphere, which is described as casual and intimate. TAP Thai Cuisine also offers takeout and reservations, making it a convenient option for those looking for a tasty and affordable Thai meal.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
