ised the Italian combo sandwich on focaccia, highlighting the delicious combination of meats, cheeses, and basil aioli. They expressed a strong preference for this sandwich and mentioned that the prices are slightly higher than average.\\n\\nOverall, Panino is a local business in Goleta known for its delicious sandwiches, friendly service, and a variety of options on their menu.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
