\\n\\\\nI definitely recommend this place. Get the turkey with provolone, Mike's way, and with jalape\u00f1os! Yummy :)\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-01 21:31:50\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Good Afternoon,\\\\nI am writing in hope that Ashley Beaty of store # 20075 in Goleta California gets recognized for outstanding customer service.  I called on Monday September 27th to place a large of 25 sandwiches for my son's school.  Ashley was courteous, knowledgeable, and very professional.  She up sold on 25 bags of chips and drinks.  In a world where customer service has deteriorated into nothingness, Ashley Beaty is out there making a difference.  When I arrived on Thursday to pick up my sandwiches, I was met with a great attitude, a well packaged and correct order.  I hope that you properly recognize her for her commitment to your company and to us the customers.\\\\nSincerely,\\\\nPhillip P.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-28 00:23:29\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This is probably the worst location I've been too. The service no matter what time of day you go is always horrible! Tried giving them another chance but this is the absolute last time I would come here.. need to hire better employees. And to make it worse the air condition is leaking.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Jersey Mike's Subs is a popular fast food chain with a location in Goleta, CA. According to the provided structured data, the restaurant is known for its delicious sandwiches, friendly service, and welcoming atmosphere. The menu offers a variety of options, including hot subs, wraps, and salads, and customers can choose from a range of toppings and sauces to customize their meals.\\n\\nReviews of the restaurant are generally positive, with many customers praising the quality of the food and the service. One reviewer noted that the staff is particularly friendly and helpful, going above and beyond to ensure customers have a great experience. Another reviewer appreciated the restaurant's willingness to accommodate large orders and deliver them promptly.\\n\\nHowever, one reviewer had a negative experience at the restaurant, citing poor service and a leaky air conditioning unit. Despite this, the overall rating for Jersey Mike's Subs remains high, with an average of 3.0 stars out of 5.\\n\\nIn summary, Jersey Mike's Subs in Goleta, CA is a popular fast food destination that offers tasty subs and a welcoming atmosphere. While some customers have had issues with service, the majority of reviews are positive, suggesting that the restaurant is a great spot for a quick and satisfying meal.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
