urant are generally positive, with many customers praising the quality of the food and the service. One reviewer noted that the staff is particularly friendly and helpful, going above and beyond to ensure customers have a great experience. Another reviewer appreciated the restaurant's willingness to accommodate large orders and deliver them promptly.\\n\\nHowever, one reviewer had a negative experience at the restaurant, citing poor service and a leaky air conditioning unit. Despite this, the overall rating for Jersey Mike's Subs remains high, with an average of 3.0 stars out of 5.\\n\\nIn summary, Jersey Mike's Subs in Goleta, CA is a popular fast food destination that offers tasty subs and a welcoming atmosphere. While some customers have had issues with service, the majority of reviews are positive, suggesting that the restaurant is a great spot for a quick and satisfying meal.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
