11.27.803.631 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Judge whether any answer claim is unsupported by the complete source. Return only JSON with p_hallucination, a number from 0 to 1. Do not use external knowledge. Input JSON follows:\n{\"source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"666 Linden Ave\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Italian, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"17:0-20:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Giannfranco's Trattoria\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-28 02:54:58\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Great family owned business. Delicious food and service. Quant outdoor patio. \\\\nHighly recommend.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-15 04:26:57\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Part of me feels bad writing this, because COVID has clearly been hard on them and I want them to succeed as a family restaurant in Carp. But, hopefully this inspires them to improve.\\\\n\\\\nThe food was excellent, but the service was strange. Our server started out sweet but soon became patronizing and made us uncomfortable. For example, we were told we can't have Parmesan cheese for the table because \\\\\\\"the cheese is from Italy\\\\\\\" (okay, what does that have to do with anything?). Then when she did stand over our plates spooning (not grating) the cheese into our dishes, she scolded us for wanting too much. Even if she was joking, we all felt weird. Also, when we made our reservation, THEY asked us if there was any special occasion. I said \\\\\\\"yes, actually, a 10 year anniversary\\\\\\\" - they even said happy anniversary to us when we arrived. But then...nothing happened. Which, whatever, but why do you ask if there is a special occasion if you're not going to do anything?? There were a few other weird things but not worth going into.\\\\n\\\\nThe server was the part owner, and maybe she was just out of her element and filling in for servers. But her table-side manner could be better. \\\\n\\\\nOn a positive note, the food was excellent and the other staff members were very friendly.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-10 03:56:05\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Back again....flavor was great and the owner told us on way in \\\\\\\"hey, kitchen is already backed up tonight so service will be slow, if you're looking to get in and out unfortunately try another night.\\\\\\\" Thank you for telling me! That set clear expectations and I wasn't anxious or annoyed waiting. \\\\n\\\\nFood was great and I love the atmosphere.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Giannfranco's Trattoria is a well-regarded Italian restaurant located in Carpinteria, California. According to the structured data, the restaurant offers outdoor seating, takeout options, and free WiFi. Customers have praised the delicious food and friendly service, with one reviewer mentioning the owner's warm hospitality. However, some customers have noted that the service can be slow, particularly during busier times. Despite this, the restaurant has received a rating of 4.0 stars and has a loyal customer base.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
