\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Party & Event Planning, Specialty Food, Delis, Food, Meat Shops, Event Planning & Services, Caterers\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Goleta\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"9:0-12:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-16:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-17:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Country Catering Company\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-31 00:59:07\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"A month ago we ordered chicken cordon blue and came home with a stuffed chicken breast which we did not like. Today we asked specifically again. We want chicken cordon blue. The attendant checked and told us that yes they had it and that certain ones were chicken cordon blue. We asked for two. we cooked  tonight no they are breasts with stuffing. We are not amused. No point in returning here although we have over decades shopped there.  Apparently they haven't a clue what they are producing anymore..\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-11 02:40:38\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Just wanted to thank Country Catering for making my family gathering on the 4th awesome!  The food was delicious and generous and nobody went hungry.\\\\nThe staff at Country Catering was so helpful and kind, it was just a kind of Goleta greatness.  Can't not mention that the pricing was so reasonable!  You guys rock!  thanks so very much\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-02-26 03:32:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We picked up some takeout here because of a friend's glowing recommendation. We were so glad that we did. Everything was absolutely delicious. We had tender tri tip, BBQ chicken, beans, broccoli, red potatoes, bread, and cookies. There was something for the entire family to enjoy. Looking forward to coming here again next time we're in the Santa Barbara area.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Sure! Here's an objective overview of the local business, Country Catering Company, based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nCountry Catering Company is a restaurant located in Goleta, California, offering a variety of services including party and event planning, specialty food, delis, and catering. They offer both dine-in and takeout options, with limited hours on weekdays and expanded hours on weekends. The business has received mixed reviews, with some customers praising the food and service while others have experienced issues with the quality of their orders.\\n\\nOne customer left a review stating that they had a negative experience with their order, specifically mentioning that they ordered chicken cordon bleu but received stuffed chicken breasts instead. Another customer had a positive experience, complimenting the food as \\\"absolutely delicious\\\" and praising the staff for being \\\"so helpful and kind.\\\" A third reviewer also had a positive experience, highlighting the variety of items available for takeout and the reasonable prices.\\n\\nBased on these reviews, it appears that Country Catering Company offers high-quality food and service, but may have some inconsistencies in their ordering and preparation process. Additionally, their hours of operation are somewhat limited, which may be a drawback for some customers. Overall, the business seems to have a good reputation in the community, but may benefit from addressing the issues raised by some of its customers.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
