risela Martinez, and their children: Lisbet, Alfredo Jr., Alex, Aldo, and Camila.\\nHe also leaves behind six grandchildren and his father, Augustine.\", \"answer\": \"Alfredo Luevano, a 53-year-old exercise rider, died during a training incident at Los Alamitos Race Course in California. He was riding a filly when the incident occurred, and despite immediate assistance, he did not survive his injuries. The details surrounding the incident are unclear, and there were no eyewitness accounts providing specific information. The filly, named Fly From The Fire, was unharmed. Luevano had a distinguished riding career and is survived by his wife, children, grandchildren, and father. The racecourse expressed condolences to his family.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
