 was close by, and we are so glad we did. Taco Grande serves up delicious food, generous portions, great prices, excellent service, and one of the best salsas I have ever eaten. We will definitely be back.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-04-20 04:48:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Was there in March. Nobody wears masks or says hello and it was empty. Went to rudys across the street and it was great.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Rasta Taco Catering is a highly-rated business located at 3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333 in Carpinteria, California. It offers a variety of services including catering, event planning, food delivery, and bartending, with a specific focus on Mexican cuisine. Its business hours are from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm on weekdays, and 9:00 am to 2:00 pm on weekends. Customers rave about the business's ability to enhance events with their services. Notable mentions include a margarita truck that adds a fun atmosphere to parties and a charismatic staff member named Mario. It has been noted that Rasta Taco Catering is a hit at military events and weddings. The business also offers street parking and outdoor seating to its customers.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70553, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
