alse,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Mexican\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"9:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"9:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"9:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"9:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"9:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"9:0-20:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"El Taco Grande\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-19 00:48:54\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"A big WOW! I found El Taco Grande by accident, across the street from another taco shop that I've been to. I decided to try it and their food is excellent! So I wouldn't feel so stuffed, I went for their solo Chile Relleno and a crispy taco (not a combination plate). I also witnessed several others enjoying their food, noticeably carne asada burritos, a few other types of tacos, and Caldo 7 Mares (seven seas soup). YOU HAVE TO TRY THIS PLACE!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-26 04:53:11\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We popped in here because it was close by, and we are so glad we did. Taco Grande serves up delicious food, generous portions, great prices, excellent service, and one of the best salsas I have ever eaten. We will definitely be back.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-04-20 04:48:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Was there in March. Nobody wears masks or says hello and it was empty. Went to rudys across the street and it was great.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Rasta Taco Catering is a highly-rated business located at 3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333 in Carpinteria, California. It offers a variety of services including catering, event planning, food delivery, and bartending, with a specific focus on Mexican cuisine. Its business hours are from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm on weekdays, and 9:00 am to 2:00 pm on weekends. Customers rave about the business's ability to enhance events with their services. Notable mentions include a margarita truck that adds a fun atmosphere to parties and a charismatic staff member named Mario. It has been noted that Rasta Taco Catering is a hit at military events and weddings. The business also offers street parking and outdoor seating to its customers.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
