he Fourth of July. We tried a sampler platter to get a little of everything. Food was delicious. Ribs had a good flavor, the pulled pork was sweet and smoky and the chicken leg was nicely sauced. The sides were very generous sized. The coleslaw had a nice flavor and slight crunch and wasn't too wet or too sweet. The pinto (?) beans were awesome, esp with a splash of habanero sauce on them. And the mac and cheese had been grilled which did dry it out a hair but imparted a great taste that was worth the trade off. All in all it was delicious and a great value at $25.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Here is a summary of the article in 200 words:\\n\\nTwo CNN Heroes, Anuradha Koirala and Pushpa Basnet, are struggling to cope with the aftermath of the devastating earthquake in Nepal. Koirala's rehabilitation center for young women and girls has been affected, with all residents sleeping outdoors due to aftershocks and a lack of safe drinking water. Basnet's Early Childhood Development Center has also been forced to evacuate, with staff and children living in a nearby field with limited resources. Both heroes are working tirelessly to provide assistance to those in need, despite the challenges they face. Other CNN Heroes have also joined relief efforts, including Jake Wood's Team Rubicon, Wilma Melville's National Disaster Search Dog Foundation, Tom Henderson's ShelterBox, Dr. Laura Stachel's We Care Solar, Arlene Samen's One Heart World-Wide, and Robin Lim's Bumi Sehat. These heroes have provided vital services such as medical care, shelter, and clean water to the affected communities.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
